            "raw_output": "23:class PatchEmbed3D(nn.Module):\n42:    def forward(self, x):\n55:class LinearEmbedding(nn.Module):\n113:        self.register_buffer(\"pos_embed\", fourier_signal)\n115:    def forward(self, x, dt):\n124:        x = x + self.pos_embed\n154:    def forward(self, x: torch.Tensor) -> torch.Tensor:\n194:    def forward(self, x: torch.Tensor) -> torch.Tensor:\n226:    def forward(self, latents: torch.Tensor, x: torch.Tensor) -> torch.Tensor:\n304:    def forward(self, latents: torch.Tensor, x: torch.Tensor) -> torch.Tensor:\n328:class PerceiverChannelEmbedding(nn.Module):\n358:        self.pos_embed = nn.Parameter(torch.zeros(1, embed_dim, self.num_patches))\n359:        trunc_normal_(self.pos_embed, std=0.02)\n361:        self.latent_queries = nn.Parameter(torch.zeros(1, num_queries, embed_dim))\n380:    def forward(self, x, dt):\n395:        x = x + self.pos_embed\n438:        self.latent_queries = nn.Parameter(torch.zeros(1, out_chans, embed_dim))\n461:    def forward(self, x: torch.Tensor) -> torch.Tensor:\nShell cwd was reset to /home/jovyan/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/filament_kyle",
