            "kind": "execute",
            "raw_output": "5:- ``HelioNetCDFDataset`` \u2014 the base dataset class used by all Surya downstream tasks.\n14:When writing a downstream task, subclass ``HelioNetCDFDataset`` and override\n71:def _resolve_s3_mode(s3_mode, s3_download_to_temp, s3_use_simplecache) -> str:\n183:def fast_inverse_transform(data, means, stds, sl_scale_factors, epsilons):\n213:def transform(\n246:def inverse_transform_single_channel(data, mean, std, sl_scale_factor, epsilon):\nShell cwd was reset to /home/jovyan/surya_workshop/downstream_apps/filament_kyle",
